{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preload","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selections","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Selection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/Selection","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11IvorConnect11SynthOutputC9SelectionV"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11IvorConnect11SynthOutputC5ErrorO"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The instruments to load."}]}],"name":"selections"}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/UsingIvorConnect"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The synth sounds only instruments it has loaded: on a device, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"channel that selects any other stays silent. (The iOS simulator and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"macOS load bank 0’s programs on demand, but no other bank’s.) Call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this before playing anything that selects an instrument outside bank","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"0. A selection the sound bank lacks loads the same program in bank 0","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead — or, in the percussion bank, the first kit — which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the channel then plays, as General MIDI Level 2 asks of a device that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lacks an instrument. A selection already loaded is skipped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Loading changes each channel it uses as if it had received the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selection’s bank select, so afterward those channels are set back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bank 0. Call it only while nothing is playing through the synth."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/Error\/instrumentPreloadFailed(_:)"},{"text":" if the synth fails","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to load them.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/preload(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11IvorConnect11SynthOutputC7preloadyyxAC5ErrorOYKSTRzAC9SelectionV7ElementRtzlF","title":"preload(_:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"IvorConnect"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preload","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","text":"Sequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11IvorConnect11SynthOutputC9SelectionV","text":"Selection","k